# Effective indices of the full and the shallow-etched slab, and the group index of their mean.
# Reference: root of the three-layer dispersion relation found with SciPy.
title 250 nm silicon slab, air cladding
stack core=0.25
materials clad=air
grating angle=10 etch=0.08
expect n_full 2.92390088 2e-07
expect n_etched 2.61786177 2e-07
expect n_grating 2.77088133 2e-07
expect group_index 3.69137297 0.0002
